{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:de894156405d3739","name":"Battlefield Effects","source":{"id":"source:reference-de894156405d3739","title":"Battlefield Effects","revision":20840,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:37:34Z","sha256":"c4e3bb83e811896fb4a3bf25ce4419745c50a51365151220eb6d2414807f4f1d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20840","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Battlefield%20Effects&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-de894156405d3739","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," can be difficult challenges for heroes. Unless the characters pack serious firepower, most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," can easily shrug off the damage caused by hand-held blasters. In addition, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," are usually able to mow down an entire adventuring group in short order.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The rules provided here transform ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," from killing machines into more manageable terrain objects that can augment an encounter rather than derail it. These effects can be offensive or defensive and can be used by the Gamemaster either to help or to hinder the heroes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Battlefield Effects are special auras that can be applied to any non-Starship ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that meets the prerequisites. A Battlefield Effect lasts until the end of the Vehicle's next turn. A Vehicle can only have one Battlefield Effect at a time, and the effect is determined prior to an encounter. Giving a Battlefield Effect to a Vehicle requires no modifications to its weapons, armor, or other systems.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To use a Battlefield Effect, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"}," of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," can make no attacks until the start of the Commander's next turn. This produces an area of effect as described in each Battlefield Effect's description. Characters or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," must be completely within the area of effect to be affected by the Battlefield Effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["REQUIRMENTS\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Anti-Personnel\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," weapon\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Allied characters and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," within 6 squares gain a +2 morale bonus to attack rolls and +1 die of damage against characters.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Defender\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["DR 10 or SR 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Any attacks targeting allied troops or Gargantuan or smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," made by attackers within 6 squares are are automatically directed at the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," with this Battlefield Effect instead. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Droid Hunter\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," weapon\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["On a successful attack, enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," within 6 squares take an additional +1 die of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage when hit by an attack that deals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ground Churner\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Tracked Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tracked_Vehicle"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Terrain within 2 squares is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"}," for the purposes of movement.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy Assault\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ground Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ground_Vehicle"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["All allied characters attacking targets within 6 squares deal +1 die of damage on a successful attack.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Medvac\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Huge or larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["All allied characters within 6 squares immediately move +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Minesweeper\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6, DR 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["All allied characters and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," within 2 squares gain a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks when locating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"},", and they take half damage from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mines"}," that they detonate.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Platoon Leader\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Expert ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["All allied characters and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," within 6 squares grant an additional +1 bonus when they use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Rapid Escape\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-Square Speed\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Allied characters and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," within 2 squares gain +2 to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["R